ItemDescription,A condensed sphere of living tidewater launched as infinite ranged ammunition from a sling.,Isang siksik na bola ng buhay na tubig-alon na ibinabala nang walang katapusan mula sa tirador.
ItemName,tidal orb,bolang agos
PropertyDescription,Innate (Bladeform): Gain 1 stack every 4 turns without taking damage (up to 10 stacks). Each stack grants +1% movement speed and +2.5% agility strike power and attack speed; lingers 4 turns after taking damage.,Likas (Anyo ng Talim): Makakuha ng 1 patong bawat 4 na turnong hindi tinatamaan ng pinsala (hanggang 10 patong). Bawat patong ay nagbibigay ng +1% bilis ng pagkilos at +2.5% lakas ng hampas sa liksi at bilis ng atake; nananatili ng 4 na turno matapos matamaan.
PropertyDescription,Innate (Ebb & Flow): Agility grants bonus movement speed and ranged attack range; Strength grants bonus spell cast range and slow resistance. Persists while morphed.,Likas (Taas at Baba ng Alon): Ang Liksi ay nagbibigay ng dagdag na bilis ng pagkilos at layo ng pag-atake sa malayo; ang Lakas ay nagbibigay ng dagdag na layo ng mahika at laban sa pagbagal. Nananatili habang nagpapalit-anyo.
PropertyDescription,"Innate (One Man Army): While no living allies are within 4 tiles (lingers 6 turns when an ally approaches), Axe gains bonus Strength equal to 50% of his excess Defence (Defence - 10), increasing melee attack damage.",
PropertyDescription,Leaping between nearby enemies in a blur of invulnerable strikes: immune to all damage and debuffs while slashing a nearby foe each turn.,Lumulundag sa pagitan ng mga kalapit na kalaban sa isang malabong ulan ng hindi matitinag na hampas: ligtas sa lahat ng pinsala at masamang epekto habang hinihiwa ang isang kalapit na kalaban bawat turno.
PropertyDescription,"Passive (Blade Dance): Melee attacks, Omnislash strikes, and Blade Fury spins have a 20% / 25% / 30% / 35% chance (by Blade Dance skill level 1-4) to critically strike for 1.8x damage.","Pasibo (Sayaw ng Talim): Ang mga malapitang atake, hampas ng Omnislash, at pag-ikot ng Poot ng Talim ay may 20% / 25% / 30% / 35% tsansa (ayon sa antas 1-4 ng Sayaw ng Talim) na magdulot ng kritikal na tama na 1.8x na pinsala."
PropertyDescription,"Passive (Counter Helix): Every 7 / 6 / 5 / 4 incoming attacks (by Counter Helix skill level 1-4, including missed attacks) triggers a 3x3 crimson axe spin dealing 100 / 120 / 140 / 160 Pure damage (1d6+3 to 3d6).",
PropertyDescription,"Spinning in a destructive storm of blades: immune to debuffs, 80% magical damage reduction, and dealing magical damage around you each turn.","Umiikot sa isang mapanirang bagyo ng mga talim: ligtas sa mga masamang epekto, 80% bawas sa pinsalang mahika, at nagdudulot ng pinsalang mahika sa paligid mo bawat turno."
