RaceName,waterkin//non-binary,nilalang ng tubig
SpellDescription,Afflict a targeted enemy within 4 to 7 tiles for 24 turns with Pure damage over time (12/16/20/24 DPS mapped via K_dmg=15) and 16%/19%/22%/25% movement slow; dispelled if the target kills any unit.,
SpellDescription,"Assume the form of a targeted creature, copying its body, attributes, skills, and spells while retaining Ebb & Flow.","Gayahin ang anyo ng target na nilalang, kinokopya ang katawan, mga katangian, kasanayan, at mahika nito habang pinapanatili ang Taas at Baba ng Alon."
SpellDescription,"Dispel debuffs and spin for 10 to 12 turns: debuff immunity, 80% magical DR, and 1d4 to 2d4+2 base magical damage per turn (85-205 DPS mapped via K_dmg=15, scaled by DEX & Bladeform attack speed) to adjacent 3x3 foes; can crit with Blade Dance.","Alisin ang masasamang epekto at umikot nang 10 hanggang 12 turno: kaligtasan sa masamang epekto, 80% bawas sa pinsalang mahika, at 1d4 hanggang 2d4+2 batayang pinsalang mahika bawat turno (85-205 DPS gamit ang K_dmg=15, nakabatay sa DEX at bilis ng Anyo ng Talim) sa mga katabing 3x3 kalaban; maaaring magkritikal gamit ang Sayaw ng Talim."
SpellDescription,"Dissolve into a surging wave, blinking forward, splashing water damage around you, and briefly gaining phasing and displacement.","Matunaw sa isang malakas na alon, sumugod pasulong, magsaboy ng pinsalang tubig sa paligid, at panandaliang makakuha ng paglusot at paglipat."
SpellDescription,"Launch a surge of water dealing base damage, knocking back, and stunning the target. Bonus damage scales with Agility-to-Strength ratio while stun duration scales with Strength-to-Agility ratio.","Magpakawala ng daluyong ng tubig na nagdudulot ng batayang pinsala, nagtutulak pabalik, at nagpapatigil sa target. Ang dagdag na pinsala ay umaayon sa rasyo ng Liksi-sa-Lakas habang ang tagal ng pagkatulala ay sa rasyo ng Lakas-sa-Liksi."
SpellDescription,"Leap to a targeted enemy and unleash 5 to 12 rapid invulnerable weapon slashes (weapon + stat + 2 to 3 bonus damage per slash) across nearby foes, triggering Blade Dance crits and Bladeform bonuses.","Lumundag sa isang target na kalaban at magpakawala ng 5 hanggang 12 mabilis at hindi matitinag na hiwa ng sandata (sandata + katangian + 2 hanggang 3 dagdag pinsala bawat hiwa) sa mga kalapit na kalaban, na nagpapagana ng kritikal ng Sayaw ng Talim at bonus ng Anyo ng Talim."
SpellDescription,Release your morphed form and immediately return to your true waterkin body.,Pakawalan ang iyong binagong anyo at agad na bumalik sa iyong tunay na katawan ng nilalang ng tubig.
SpellDescription,"Roar to taunt enemies within 2 tiles (3 with Lv 25 talent) for 4 to 6 turns, silencing their spells and forcing them to march and attack Axe while granting +6 to +8 Defence (+10 with Lv 15 talent).",
SpellDescription,"Shift Agility into Strength and Constitution (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats while raising both maximum and current HP.","Ilipat ang Liksi patungong Lakas at Pangangatawan (1 hanggang 5 puntos ayon sa kahusayan), pinapanatili ang kabuuang katangian habang itinataas ang parehong pinakamataas at kasalukuyang HP."
SpellDescription,"Shift Strength and Constitution into Agility (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats and lowering maximum HP without draining current HP.","Ilipat ang Lakas at Pangangatawan patungong Liksi (1 hanggang 5 puntos ayon sa kahusayan), pinapanatili ang kabuuang katangian at binababa ang pinakamataas na HP nang hindi inuubos ang kasalukuyang HP."
SpellDescription,"Strike a nearby foe (range 2) with Pure force: instantly executes targets at or below 18/25/32 HP (+mastery/talent), refunding 100% mana, granting nearby allies +25% move speed and +7/+8/+8 Defence for 12 turns, and stacking permanent armor; otherwise deals 5d6+1 to 9d6 Pure damage.",
SpellDescription,"Summon a fragile movable Healing Ward (1 HP, max 1 active) for 36 to 48 turns that heals all allies within 2 tiles for 1% to 3.25% of their maximum HP each turn.","Tumawag ng marupok at gumagalaw na Totem ng Paghilom (1 HP, max 1 aktibo) sa loob ng 36 hanggang 48 turno na nagpapagaling sa lahat ng kakampi sa loob ng 2 puwang ng 1% hanggang 3.25% ng kanilang pinakamataas na HP bawat turno."
